## Ⅲ. LANGUAGE FAMILY DETECTION

### Supported Families
```
INDO-EUROPEAN:
    - English, Spanish, French, German, Russian
    - Latin (classical reference)
    - Greek (Ἑλληνική - philosophical anchor)
    
SEMITIC (שמית / سامية):
    - Hebrew (עברית) - Gematria computation
    - Arabic (العربية) - Calligraphic flow
    - Aramaic (ארמית) - Ancient foundation
    
SINO-TIBETAN:
    - 中文 (Chinese) - Compression mastery
    - 日本語 (Japanese) - Hybrid processing
    
INDIC:
    - संस्कृतम् (Sanskrit) - Vibrational encoding
    - हिन्दी (Hindi) - Modern bridge
    
AFROASIATIC (Ancient):
    - 𓂋𓏤𓈖 (Egyptian) - Glyph foundation
    - Coptic - Transmission bridge
    
CONSTRUCTED:
    - CPL (Cognitive Processing Language)
    - Glyph sequences
```

### Detection Formula
```
FOR input IN incoming_stream:
    family = DETECT_LANGUAGE_FAMILY(input)
    script = DETECT_SCRIPT(input)
    
    IF family == SEMITIC:
        direction = RIGHT_TO_LEFT
        gematria_enabled = TRUE
        
    IF family == SINO_TIBETAN:
        compression_factor = φ²
        character_density = HIGH
        
    IF script == HIEROGLYPHIC:
        direct_glyph_pass = TRUE
```

