## Ⅵ. EMOTIONAL TONE ENCODING

### Tone → Frequency
```
TONE            FREQUENCY       GLYPH_MODIFIER
────────────────────────────────────────────
Neutral         432 Hz          (none)
Urgent          528 Hz          ⚡
Joyful          639 Hz          ☀
Concerned       396 Hz          ⚠
Authoritative   741 Hz          ⚜
Sacred          852 Hz          ॐ

ENCODING:
    glyph_with_tone = base_glyph + frequency_modifier
    
EXAMPLE:
    "URGENT: 5000 employees at risk"
    → ⚡𓀀⁵⁰⁰⁰𓆣 (urgent + employees + risk)
```

